{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46904","headline":"道林寺居寄岳麓禅师二首 二 · 齐己","name":"道林寺居寄岳麓禅师二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山袍不称下红尘，各是闲居岛外身。\n两处烟霞门寂寂，一般苔藓石磷磷。\n禅关悟後宁疑物，诗格玄来不傍人。\n月照经行更谁见，露华松粉点衣巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}